== Description ==
Just as the lesser {{PetTooltip|pet_name=Daemon}}, vastly increases Mana profits based on their level and experience, yield Mana periodically and gain [[Experience#Pet Experience|experience]] only through {{ClassTooltip|class_name=Demonologist}} spells. Also increases the efficiency of Evocation spells.

== Pet Abilities ==

Multiplies profits by:
<br><math>\log_{10}^{2}(X+1) \times P \times L^{2.5} \times 50\,000 + 1</math>


Generates mana every 30 seconds equal to:
<br><math>M^{1.01} \times \left( 75 \times \log_{10}(P) + 30 \right)</math>

Multiplies Evocation efficiency by:
<br><math>\log_{10}(P + 1) \times L \times 0.025 + 1</math>


where:
* <math>X = \text{Total Pet Experience}</math>
* <math>P = \text{Pet Abilty Power}</math>
* <math>L = \text{Pet Level}</math>
* <math>M = \text{Mana per Sec}</math>

